{"compatibility":"minor","safety_note_md":"# SafeStan Safety Note

Compatibility: minor.

Protected data: `chosen_action`.

Generated files: `model_safe.stan`, `data_safe.json`.

Changes: moved the computation of the categorical-logit linear predictor to the likelihood statement after the prior on `beta`. This preserves the same posterior/log density while satisfying SafeStan's requirement that each parameter receive its prior before being used in the model block. No data changes were required.
","model_safe_stan":"// ForestDB translation: Schelling Coordination Game with False Belief
data {
  int<lower=1> A;
  int<lower=1> N;
  array[N] int<lower=1, upper=A> chosen_action;
  vector[A] utility;
}
parameters {
  real<lower=0> beta;
}
model {
  beta ~ lognormal(0, 0.75);
  chosen_action ~ categorical_logit(beta * utility);
}
generated quantities {
  simplex[A] action_prob = softmax(beta * utility);
}
","data_safe_json":"{"A":3,"N":5,"chosen_action":[2,2,3,3,2],"utility":[3.933758561687393,4.167238615045729,2.7168182977290023]}","protected_variables":["chosen_action"]}
